{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607160/extras/06757a17d7c99011e0407bddd45643da.avif?t=1737439493\" width=610 height=100 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not doubt! This scarecrow-like thing is the incarnation of a god! Assign your villagers to automatically collect the resources needed for settlement development, or you can personally carry a dozen logs!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607160/extras/af2f2ebf846305662e72f0781ba89a61.poster.avif?t=1737439493\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607160/extras/af2f2ebf846305662e72f0781ba89a61.webm?t=1737439493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607160/extras/c81a35dd6ac763cbf92e95b08384cab4.avif?t=1737439493\" width=610 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your territory, build houses for your people. And make them work for you! Don't forge to build extravagant solid gold statues to praise your wise leadership! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607160/extras/f08477d7e78b6cf8892d7cbf831cfb6a.poster.avif?t=1737439493\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607160/extras/f08477d7e78b6cf8892d7cbf831cfb6a.webm?t=1737439493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607160/extras/bb5654bf10a1242297ca02c6d07b12e7.avif?t=1737439493\" width=610 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See these laser towers, built specifically to roast kobolds! There are also turrets and archery towers you can use to defend your home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607160/extras/05aba887a069fdb33f96818eaac5cd68.poster.avif?t=1737439493\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607160/extras/05aba887a069fdb33f96818eaac5cd68.webm?t=1737439493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607160/extras/9f3a282640d953b7f1cf8e4dc938d565.avif?t=1737439493\" width=610 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allocate manpower according to your needs (or pure bad taste), and you can even make your creation work 23 hours a day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.ste